    "body": "> I think browsers might already use the first legend element child instead of the first element child if that happens to be a legend element\n\nYes *that* is the case, but I'm wondering about relaxing it further so even a *grand*child (or some deeper descendant) `legend` still counts as the accessible name for its ancestor `fieldset`",
