    "body": "I see, that would indeed be a more invasive change and potentially expensive. At least it seems that descendants of this first `legend` element are currently not disabled for instance, which is mostly managed through the children changed hook. That would then instead have to be done through insertion steps and state bookkeeping. And we'd have to consider if we want to make the same kind of change for the `optgroup` element where the `legend` element is now also allowed.",
