    "body": "i *think* for `optgroup` the behavior/expectation can remain the same, as i don't think there's a situation where an author would need to more deeply nest a `legend` in there (though perhaps the work in OpenUI might bring up such scenarios https://open-ui.org/components/customizableselect/ ... not investigated this yet)",
