    "created_at": "2026-06-01T14:21:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-01T14:23:09Z",
    "body": "or guard-rail it so that and `optgroup` `legend` is excluded from bubbling up to becoming the `legend` for the `fieldset`.\n\nalso, obviously, if there's nested `fieldset`s, the `legend` should not break out of its closest parent `fieldset`.\n\nbeyond that, i don't believe there's any other uses of `legend`. and if future ones come up, they can be guard-railed similarly.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
