    "updated_at": "2026-06-01T14:23:59Z",
    "body": "Right, but if we later want to add `legend` to another existing element like we did with `optgroup`, we'd run into a backwards compatibility issue if someone was using a deeply nested `legend` for the ancestor `fieldset`. Might be okay to break such cases, but the issue seems real.",
